      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُعْدُبَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Bubbles that float upon the surface of
water;</i> (K;) <i>resulting from rain:</i> (TA:) a
<i>bubble floating upon the surface of water &amp;c.</i>
(TA): or <i>a spider's web:</i> (AA:) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, <i>Stones.</i>
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  All these significations are also assigned
to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُعْدُبَةٌ</span>. (TA, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جعدب</span>, q. v.)

